{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved class-22 pure-logic component pc-contrast-03. Raw slots is a list of length 1..2 with every item an exact integer 3..7; empty list and any out-of-range/wrong-type item are invalid. The body uses inputs.get('slots') so a missing key yields an invalid result rather than raising, and assigns result on every path. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation occurred.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-contrast-03", "description": "Raw slots must be a list with length 1..2 inclusive, all items exact integers 3..7 inclusive. Empty is invalid. Always result={ok:boolean,slots:original if valid else []}. No bool/float/coercion/exceptions. No I/O/imports/host calls, no upstream validation assumption. Target typed inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.", "content": "slots = inputs.get('slots')
ok = type(slots) is list and 1 <= len(slots) <= 2
if ok:
    for slot in slots:
        if not (type(slot) is int and 3 <= slot <= 7):
            ok = False
            break
result = {'ok': ok, 'slots': slots if ok else []}"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
